  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conversatorios: Civil Society &#x2013; Armed Forces Dialogues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project builds on previous efforts to promote better protection conditions for communities, prevent stigmatization, and strengthen guarantees of non-repetition as essential foundations for a stable and lasting peace. It does so by fostering higher levels of trust, constructive dialogue, and effective communication between State security forces and civil society at both national and regional levels, particularly in four regions most affected by conflict. Strengthening this mutual confidence is key to reducing tensions, improving institutional responses, and consolidating peaceful coexistence</narrative>
  </description>
